      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test. The original has many unused imports and two unused helper methods (`data_plus`, `data_minus`). I'll clean those up and add grouping comments to make the month-to-quarter mapping clear.The improved test compiles successfully. The refactored version removes ~50 unused imports and two unused helper methods (`data_plus`/`data_minus`), then adds inline comments grouping each quarter's months, making the month-to-quarter mapping immediately clear."
